速くていいね！
Oh, nice and fast!

587
00:42:32,457 --> 00:42:35,757
うん、ちょっと面白いシャボン玉ダンスもできたしね！
Yeah, and we got to do the bubble dance, which is a little bit silly!

588
00:42:35,757 --> 00:42:37,457
びっくりした？
But did we surprise you?

589
00:42:37,457 --> 00:42:42,057
うん、みんなの顔をいつもよりさらに近くで見られたよ！
Yeah, and we got to see your faces even more close-up than usual!

590
00:42:42,057 --> 00:42:43,557
うん！
Yeah!

591
00:42:43,557 --> 00:42:48,457
さっき歌った2曲は、おかゆ先輩と一緒の「キミコイ」と…
Well, the last two songs we sang was "Kiss me! Choose me!" together with Okayu-senpai...

592
00:42:48,457 --> 00:42:54,757
…そして、フブキ先輩、ミオ先輩、スバル先輩と一緒の「トライアングル・ドリーマー」でした！
...and "Triangle Dreamer" with Fubuki-senpai, Mio-senpai, and Subaru-senpai!

593
00:42:55,457 --> 00:42:57,757
Ruffians、どうだった？
What did you think, Ruffians?

594
00:42:57,757 --> 00:43:02,657
「キミコイ」はおかゆ先輩とずっと一緒に歌いたかった曲なんだ！
Oh, "Kiss me! Choose me!" is a song that we've always wanted to sing together with Okayu-senpai!

595
00:43:02,657 --> 00:43:06,257
うん、ちょっとセクシーな曲だよね！
Yeah, it's a little bit more sexy song!

596
00:43:06,257 --> 00:43:08,757
ちょっとセクシーな曲だよね、はい！
A bit sexy song, right!

597
00:43:08,757 --> 00:43:13,457
うん！そしてフェスアイドル曲の「トライアングル・ドリーマー」！
Yeah! And "Triangle Dreamer", the festival idol song!

598
00:43:13,457 --> 00:43:17,057
うん、振り付けがすごく可愛かった！Ruffians、まだ息してる？
Yeah, the choreography was so cute! Ruffians, are you still alive?

599
00:43:17,057 --> 00:43:21,457
え、生きてる？
Uh, are you alive?

600
00:43:21,457 --> 00:43:24,057
やった、Ruffians！
Yeah, Ruffians!

601
00:43:24,057 --> 00:43:27,457
先輩たちすごく可愛かったね！わあ！
Our senpais were so cute! Wow!

602
00:43:27,457 --> 00:43:30,457
うん！それにシャボン玉で客席の上を浮いたときは…
Yeah! And when crowd surfing with the bubbles...

603
00:43:30,457 --> 00:43:33,457
うん、すごかった！
Yeah, wow! Oh my gosh!

604
00:43:33,457 --> 00:43:35,457
初めてのことだったね！
It was a first!

605
00:43:35,457 --> 00:43:38,457
今年はいろんな「初めて」があるね！
A lot of firsts this year, right?

606
00:43:38,457 --> 00:43:39,757
うん！
Yeah!

607
00:43:39,757 --> 00:43:42,457
そして、小さなお知らせがあります！
Well, we have a tiny, tiny announcement!

608
00:43:42,457 --> 00:43:45,757
フワモコとしての誕生日だからね！
Oh, you know, as FUWAMOCO, it's our birthday, right?

609
00:43:45,757 --> 00:43:48,457
そう、誕生日！
Yeah, our birthday!

610
00:43:48,457 --> 00:43:50,757
なので、みんなにお知らせしたいことがあります！
And so, we have something we'd like to share with you!

611
00:43:50,757 --> 00:43:53,457
オッケー、いっせーのーで！
Okay, on three!

612
00:43:53,457 --> 00:43:55,057
どうぞ！
Here it is!

613
00:43:55,057 --> 00:43:58,557
ばうばう！FUWAMOCO 2026の誕生日グッズで、二人の誕生日をお祝いする時間だよ！
Bow-wow! It's time to celebrate both of our birthdays with our FUWAMOCO 2026 Birthday Merch!

614
00:43:58,557 --> 00:44:02,557
誕生日記念フルセット！
Birthday Set!

615
00:44:02,557 --> 00:44:08,557
フワモコの生誕グッズ紹介、始まるよ！ばう！
FUWAMOCO's Birthday Merch showcase is starting! Bau!

616
00:44:08,557 --> 00:44:18,557
まずは、私たちのママであるイコモチママが描き下ろしてくれた「ふわふわアイドル☆FUWAWA」と「もこもこアイドル☆MOCOCO」のアクリルスタンドで、ふわふわもこもこなアイドルになっちゃおう！
First, you can become fluffy and fuzzy idols with the "Fuwa Fuwa Idol☆Fuwawa" and "Moco Moco Idol☆Mococo" Acrylic Stands drawn by our Mama, Ikomochi-mama!

617
00:44:18,557 --> 00:44:24,057
通常のアクリルスタンドに比べて結構大きいので、コレクションに加えるのにぴったりだと思います！
They're rather big compared to regular acrylic stands, so we think they'll be a great addition to your collection!

618
00:44:24,057 --> 00:44:29,557
大きめサイズで可愛いアイドルのフワモコアクリルスタンド！
Big-sized and cute FUWAMOCO Acrylic Stands!

619
00:44:29,557 --> 00:44:35,557
次は、お茶目な「えへへえんじぇる☆ラバーマスコット」と「HOEH?!でびる☆ラバーマスコット」です！
Next, we have the silly "Ehehe Angel☆Rubber Figurine" and "HOEH?! Devil☆Rubber Figurine"!

620
00:44:35,557 --> 00:44:39,557
机の上に飾るのにぴったりな手のひらサイズのフィギュアです。
They're palm-sized figures perfect for displaying on your desk.

621
00:44:39,557 --> 00:44:44,557
かわいい衣装のフワモコが手のひらサイズのラバーマスコットになったよ！
FUWAMOCO in cute outfits are now palm-sized rubber mascots!

622
00:44:44,557 --> 00:44:54,557
これが目玉だよ！お出かけカジュアル衣装のフワモコぬいぐるみがついに登場！でも今回は、抱きしめるとおしゃべりもしちゃうんです！
This one is big! We finally have FUWAMOCO plushies in our out-and-about casual outfits! But this time, we also speak when you hug us!

623
00:44:54,557 --> 00:44:58,057
「おしゃべりぱぴー☆FUWAWAぬいぐるみ」と「おしゃべりぱぴー☆MOCOCOぬいぐるみ」です！
It's the "Yappy Puppy☆FUWAWA" and "Yappy Puppy☆MOCOCO" Sounds Plushies!

624
00:44:58,057 --> 00:45:01,057
フレンズのやっぴーぬいぐるみと同じサイズだから、一緒に並べて飾れるよ。
We'll be the same size as our friends' yappi plushies, so you can display them together.

625
00:45:02,472 --> 00:45:04,472
おしゃべりパピーぬいぐるみのフワモコだよ！
I'm the talking puppy plushie, Fuwamoco!

626
00:45:04,472 --> 00:45:05,872
ぎゅっとすると、いろいろ喋るよ！
If you squeeze us, we'll say all kinds of things!

627
00:45:05,872 --> 00:45:07,972
どんなボイスが出るかお楽しみに！
Look forward to what kind of voices will come out!

628
00:45:07,972 --> 00:45:10,972
We have the Fuwawa to GO! Finger Puppet!

629
00:45:10,972 --> 00:45:13,472
Oh!

630
00:45:13,472 --> 00:45:15,572
They both come with one extra Ruffians kigurumi costume...

631
00:45:15,572 --> 00:45:17,072
...you can dress us up in and bring around with you everywhere!

632
00:45:17,072 --> 00:45:21,872
フワワの指パペット！
And Fuwawa's Finger Puppet!

633
00:45:21,872 --> 00:45:23,772
どこでも一緒に連れて行けるサイズで、
They're the perfect size to take with you anywhere...

634
00:45:23,772 --> 00:45:26,172
着せ替えラフィアンズ衣装もあるよ！
...and even include dress-up Ruffians outfits!

635
00:45:26,172 --> 00:45:29,172
Finally, we have two different ASMR Voice Packs!

636
00:45:29,172 --> 00:45:32,772
\"Back from a Fluffy Date\" with Fuwawa, and...

637
00:45:32,772 --> 00:45:36,172
...\"Sweet and Fuzzy Needy Puppy\" from Mococo!

638
00:45:36,172 --> 00:45:39,772
ASMRボイスは、英語と日本語、両方で収録してます！
The ASMR voices are recorded in both English and Japanese!

639
00:45:39,772 --> 00:45:44,072
We made our hearts beat so fast!

640
00:45:44,072 --> 00:45:46,672
Be ready to blush when you take a listen to them!

641
00:45:46,672 --> 00:45:49,372
The merch is separated into two sets...

642
00:45:49,372 --> 00:45:52,472
...Fuwawa's Birthday Merch and Mococo's Birthday Merch!

643
00:45:52,472 --> 00:45:56,072
If you purchase the full set, they come with bonuses...

644
00:45:56,072 --> 00:45:58,972
...including a cheki-style card with a special bonus voice!

645
00:45:58,972 --> 00:46:03,072
グッズはフワワセットとモココセットに分かれています！
The merch is split into a Fuwawa set and a Mococo set!

646
00:46:03,072 --> 00:46:06,572
セットごとに、チェキ風カードと特典ボイスが付きます！
Each set comes with a cheki-style card and bonus voice!

647
00:46:06,572 --> 00:46:11,172
The regular version will have a foil-stamped replica signature and message, so it'll be just as cute!

648
00:46:11,172 --> 00:46:16,672
数量限定セットは、直筆サイン付きだよ！
The limited edition set comes with an autographed signature!

649
00:46:16,672 --> 00:46:20,472
We put lots of love into each and every signature, so we hope you look forward to it!

650
00:46:20,472 --> 00:46:24,972
たくさん愛情込めてサイン書きますね！
We'll put lots of love into signing them!

651
00:46:24,972 --> 00:46:27,972
Please check out the hololive official online shop...

652
00:46:27,972 --> 00:46:30,872
...and look for the link in the description or comment area, okay?

653
00:46:30,872 --> 00:46:33,672
ぜひ、ホロライブ公式ショップにチェックしてください！
Please check them out on the hololive official online shop!

654
00:46:33,672 --> 00:46:37,972
BAU BAU!

655
00:46:37,972 --> 00:46:39,872
What did you think of our birthday merch? Pretty cute, right?

656
00:46:39,872 --> 00:46:44,972
The reservations will go on sale right after the birthday live here ends, so don't forget, okay?

657
00:46:44,972 --> 00:46:50,972
生誕のグッズの予約は、
Reservations for the birthday merch...

658
00:46:50,972 --> 00:46:54,872
...このあと開始しますので、お忘れずにチェックしてください！
...will start right after this, so don't forget to check it out!

659
00:46:54,872 --> 00:46:59,272
Make sure to check the link below, or on the side here! Yes!

660
00:46:59,272 --> 00:47:02,772
And don't forget, okay? We put a lot of love into it, and Icomochi-mama too!

661
00:47:02,772 --> 00:47:06,972
Right after this ends, it's time to...

662
00:47:06,972 --> 00:47:10,972
...GO! GO! GO! Okay?

663
00:47:10,972 --> 00:47:13,272
GO BAU!

664
00:47:13,272 --> 00:47:15,972
We performed a lot of special collab songs with our senpai...

665
00:47:15,972 --> 00:47:20,672
...but there's still one mystery guest we haven't met yet, right?

666
00:47:20,672 --> 00:47:23,172
そう、まだ会ってない謎のゲストが一人いるんだよね！
That's right, there's still one mystery guest we haven't met yet!

667
00:47:23,172 --> 00:47:28,972
Well, should we give the Ruffians a hint first?

668
00:47:28,972 --> 00:47:32,272
Ruffians, you're curious, right?

669
00:47:32,272 --> 00:47:34,872
クロちゃ、クロちゃん？
Kuro-cha... Kuro-chan?

670
00:47:34,872 --> 00:47:38,572
That's a guest maybe?
That's our guest maybe?

671
00:47:38,572 --> 00:47:41,572
We will see!

672
00:47:41,572 --> 00:47:44,972
Maybe you should get ready, because you know, they aren't quite as bad as Pero...

673
00:47:44,972 --> 00:47:50,672
...but they can get pretty nasty sometimes!

674
00:47:50,672 --> 00:47:54,972
Mocochyan, that's not kind to be rude to our next guest or anything, right?

675
00:47:54,972 --> 00:47:59,672
Especially before calling them out!

676
00:47:59,672 --> 00:48:02,272
We will see!

677
00:48:02,272 --> 00:48:03,772
Well, let's get them out here then! Who could it be? Who could it be?

678
00:48:03,772 --> 00:48:09,972
せーの、どうぞ！
Ready, go ahead!

679
00:48:09,972 --> 00:48:14,772
わー！来たしん！来たしんよ！
Wow! I'm here! I'm here!

680
00:48:14,772 --> 00:48:19,272
来たしんよー！ちゅっちゅ！
I'm here! Chu chu!

681
00:48:19,272 --> 00:48:22,772
自己紹介お願いします！
Please introduce yourself!

682
00:48:22,772 --> 00:48:25,372
クロちゃんです！わー！
I'm Kuro-chan! Wah!

683
00:48:25,372 --> 00:48:28,972
だしんよー！
Indeed!

684
00:48:28,972 --> 00:48:31,572
はじめまして！
Nice to meet you!

685
00:48:31,572 --> 00:48:33,372
チワワじゃないよ、フワワだよ！
I'm not Chihuahua, I'm Fuwawa!

686
00:48:33,372 --> 00:48:36,472
フワワじゃないよ、モココだよ！
I'm not Fuwawa, I'm Mococo!

687
00:48:36,472 --> 00:48:39,072
二人合わせて、フワモコです！
And together we are Fuwamoco!

688
00:48:39,072 --> 00:48:42,472
BAU BAU!

689
00:48:42,472 --> 00:48:46,072
よろしくお願いします！
We look forward to working with you!

690
00:48:46,072 --> 00:48:48,872
フワモコのわちょわちょバースデーフェスティバルに来てくれてありがとうございます！
Thank you for coming to Fuwamoco's Wacho-Wacho Birthday Festival!

691
00:48:48,872 --> 00:48:54,072
ハッピーバースデーだしんよ、フワモコ！
Happy Birthday, Fuwamoco!

692
00:48:54,072 --> 00:48:59,272
ちょっとね、えっと...
So... um...

693
00:48:59,272 --> 00:49:02,772
視聴者のラフィアンズはたくさんいると思いますけど、
I'm sure we have many Ruffians watching us, but...

694
00:49:02,772 --> 00:49:05,972
クロちゃんがどんな人なのか説明してもらえますか？
...could you explain what kind of person you are, Kuro-chan?

695
00:49:05,972 --> 00:49:09,972
え、自分でスんの？それ。
Eh? I have to do it myself?

696
00:49:09,972 --> 00:49:12,972
自己紹介！
Self-introduction!

697
00:49:12,972 --> 00:49:14,872
わかったしんよ。だってこれ海外の人も見てますもんね？
Okay then. I mean, we have overseas viewers too, right?

698
00:49:14,872 --> 00:49:17,972
海外の人もわかる自己紹介しますからね。
I'll do an introduction that overseas viewers can understand too!

699
00:49:17,972 --> 00:49:20,972
Nice to meet you, nice to meet you, chu chu chu chu tulip!
Nice to meet you, nice to meet you, chu-chu-chu-chu Tulip!

700
00:49:20,972 --> 00:49:25,972
Tulip!

701
00:49:25,972 --> 00:49:28,972
え？止まらないで？
Eh? Don't stop there!

702
00:49:28,972 --> 00:49:30,972
え？クロちゃん、え？チューリップ？
Eh? Kuro-chan, eh? Tulip?

703
00:49:30,972 --> 00:49:33,972
いや、チューリップ、ノー、ノー。
No, Tulip, no, no.

704
00:49:33,972 --> 00:49:35,972
ちょっとまだわからないかもしれないから...
They might not understand it yet, so...

705
00:49:35,972 --> 00:49:38,972
安田大サーカスっていうトリオを組んでる芸人さんで、
Well, I'm a comedian in a trio called Yasuda Dai Circus...

706
00:49:38,972 --> 00:49:43,972
あと豆柴の大群のプロデューサーもやってます。
...and I also produce the group Mameshiba no Taigun.

707
00:49:43,972 --> 00:49:46,672
作詞とかもしています、クロちゃんです！
I write lyrics too. I'm Kuro-chan!

708
00:49:46,672 --> 00:49:49,972
わー！じゃあ今回は英語でお願いします！
Wow! Now, please do it in English!

709
00:49:49,972 --> 00:49:53,972
え？僕が？
Eh, me?

710
00:49:53,972 --> 00:49:55,872
自分で？
Yourself?

711
00:49:55,872 --> 00:49:57,672
え、そんなこと急に言われたら、It's shy!
Eh, if you tell me so suddenly... It's shy!

712
00:50:02,527 --> 00:50:04,027
言い訳はなし！
No excuses!

713
00:50:04,027 --> 00:50:05,927
人の話聞いてる？
Are you listening to me?

714
00:50:05,927 --> 00:50:07,027
頑張って！
Do your best!

715
00:50:07,027 --> 00:50:09,727
ええと、なんだろう？有名...
Let's see, what is it? Famous...

716
00:50:09,727 --> 00:50:11,527
有名コメディアン！
Famous comedian!

717
00:50:11,527 --> 00:50:13,127
おー！コメディアン！
Oh! Comedian!

718
00:50:13,127 --> 00:50:15,127
あと、アイドルプロデューサー！
And idol producer!

719
00:50:15,127 --> 00:50:17,727
いやいや、かっこいい！やってるしね！
Wow, that's so cool! You actually do that!

720
00:50:17,727 --> 00:50:20,427
できる、できる！
You can do it, you can do it!

721
00:50:21,327 --> 00:50:24,127
クロちゃんテレビでよく見てるけど...
I watch Kuro-chan on TV all the time, but...

722
00:50:24,127 --> 00:50:29,127
フワモコのペット of ペロちゃんと、ちょっと似てるところがたくさんあるね！
...there are a lot of similarities between you and our pet, Pero-chan!

723
00:50:29,127 --> 00:50:31,727
そうそう！
Yeah, yeah!

724
00:50:31,727 --> 00:50:34,727
ちょっと後ろの壁見てくださいね！
Please look at the wall behind us!

725
00:50:35,327 --> 00:50:38,027
そう、それペロです！
Yes, that's Pero!

726
00:50:38,027 --> 00:50:41,527
ちょっと待って、丸いところが似てるだけじゃない？
Wait a minute, isn't it just because we're both round?

727
00:50:41,527 --> 00:50:44,127
違う、違う！
No, no!

728
00:50:44,927 --> 00:50:48,427
クロちゃんと似てるところは、嘘つきで、女の子好きで...
The similarities between you and Kuro-chan are: lying, loving girls...

729
00:50:48,427 --> 00:50:50,927
いやらしい！
...and sleazy!

730
00:50:51,927 --> 00:50:54,127
だから、見た目で騙されないで！
So, don't be fooled by appearances!

731
00:50:54,127 --> 00:50:56,727
え、クロちゃんはそれで大丈夫なの？言われて。
Wait, is Kuro-chan okay with being called that?

732
00:50:56,927 --> 00:51:00,927
いや、ひどい！悲しくなってきた！えーんえーん！
No, that's terrible! I'm starting to get sad! *Crying*

733
00:51:01,327 --> 00:51:04,727
えんぽいぽい、ふん！
*Scoffs*

734
00:51:04,927 --> 00:51:08,727
全然人の話聞かないよね、君たちは。
You girls really don't listen to anyone, do you?

735
00:51:08,927 --> 00:51:14,527
できれば、クロちゃんはペロの友達になってくれませんか？
If possible, Kuro-chan, won't you be friends with Pero?

736
00:51:15,127 --> 00:51:17,727
フワモコの友達じゃなくて、ペロの友達になるの？
Not Fuwamoco's friend, but Pero's friend?!

737
00:51:17,927 --> 00:51:21,927
そう、フワモコはクロちゃんと友達になりたくないから！
Yeah, because Fuwamoco doesn't want to be friends with Kuro-chan!

738
00:51:21,927 --> 00:51:22,927
おかしくない、それ？
Isn't that weird?!

739
00:51:22,927 --> 00:51:25,927
嫌だ、嫌だ！気持ち悪いから！
No way, no way! Because it's creepy!

740
00:51:25,927 --> 00:51:28,427
気持ち悪くない！マニアには受ける！
I'm not creepy! I'm popular with specific demographics!

741
00:51:28,427 --> 00:51:30,927
違う！フワモコ気持ち悪いやっぱり！
No! Fuwamoco still thinks you're creepy after all!

742
00:51:30,927 --> 00:51:35,327
でも、でも、モコちゃん、ちょっとやりすぎですよ、失礼です！
But Moco-chan, that's a bit too much, that's rude.

743
00:51:35,927 --> 00:51:42,327
もし、もしもペロと仲良くなってほしいんだったら、フワモコちゃん、クロちゃんに可愛らしく頼んだ方がいいんじゃない？
If you want me to be friends with Pero, shouldn't you ask me nicely, Fuwamoco?

744
00:51:42,327 --> 00:51:44,427
はぁ！？
What?!

745
00:51:44,427 --> 00:51:46,927
ノー！/ノー！
No! / No!

746
00:51:46,927 --> 00:51:48,927
しっかりとした否定！
A flat-out rejection!

747
00:51:49,927 --> 00:51:53,427
けど、ペロ可愛いから仲良くなってもいいとは思ってるよ。
But Pero is cute, so I think it's fine for us to be friends.

748
00:51:53,427 --> 00:51:55,527
うれしい、うれしい！
Yay, we're so happy!

749
00:51:55,527 --> 00:51:59,527
可愛くないけど、なんか仲良くなってくれたら嬉しいかな！
You're not cute, but we'd be happy if you became friends!

750
00:51:59,527 --> 00:52:02,527
感情が、感情がいろいろありすぎるのよ、本当に。
You have way too many conflicting emotions going on, seriously!

751
00:52:02,927 --> 00:52:04,927
まあ、まあ！
Well, well!

752
00:52:04,927 --> 00:52:08,927
クロちゃんって芸人さんだけど、アイドルになりたいんですよね！
Kuro-chan, you're a comedian, but you want to be an idol, right?

753
00:52:09,927 --> 00:52:14,927
そう、元々アイドルになろうと思ったのに、騙されて芸人にさせられたから。
Yes, originally I wanted to be an idol, but I was tricked into becoming a comedian.

754
00:52:14,927 --> 00:52:17,927
アイドルは本当に夢、ドリーム！
Being an idol is truly my dream!

755
00:52:17,927 --> 00:52:20,427
なんか悲しいな。可哀想。
That's kind of sad. Poor thing...

756
00:52:20,427 --> 00:52:22,427
でもドリームって大事！
But dreams are important!

757
00:52:23,927 --> 00:52:27,727
そう。で、まあ、クロちゃんのドリームはアイドルなんだから...
Right. Since Kuro-chan's dream is to be an idol...

758
00:52:27,727 --> 00:52:31,927
もうせっかく、一緒に歌ってくれませんか？
...since you're here, won't you sing with us?

759
00:52:32,527 --> 00:52:35,727
あ、いいよいいよ！いいよ、オッケーだしよ！
Ah, sure! I'd love to!

760
00:52:35,727 --> 00:52:37,727
一緒に歌えるんだ！
We get to sing together!

761
00:52:37,727 --> 00:52:39,927
どの曲、どの曲？どの曲にする？
Which song? Which song are we doing?

762
00:52:39,927 --> 00:52:41,727
あの、ハードル上げないで。
Please don't raise the bar too high!

763
00:52:41,727 --> 00:52:43,727
大丈夫！
It's okay!

764
00:52:43,727 --> 00:52:46,727
ね、アイドルのプロデューサーもやってるし。
After all, you're also an idol producer.

765
00:52:46,727 --> 00:52:49,727
実力見せてよ！
Show us what you've got!

766
00:52:49,727 --> 00:52:51,927
オッケーだしよ、行くよ行くよ！
Okay then, here we go!

767
00:52:51,927 --> 00:52:53,427
オッケー！
Okay!

768
00:52:53,427 --> 00:52:57,927
じゃあ、すごく可愛い曲を一緒に歌いましょう！
Then let's sing a super cute song together!

769
00:52:57,927 --> 00:53:00,127
何、何かな？楽しみ！
What song is it? I'm excited!

770
00:53:00,127 --> 00:53:01,927
オッケー！
Okay!

771
00:53:02,927 --> 00:53:05,927
じゃあ、一緒にタイトルコールしましょうね！
Let's do the title call together!

772
00:53:06,427 --> 00:53:08,927
せーの、ちゅ、多様性。
Ready, go! Chu, Tayousei.!

773
00:53:08,927 --> 00:53:10,927
ちゅ、多様性やるの！？
We're doing "Chu, Tayousei."?!

774
00:53:28,927 --> 00:53:31,927
我愛你 酔いが醒めない
I love you, my intoxication won't fade

775
00:53:31,927 --> 00:53:35,127
Oh, I need you 恋が醒めない
Oh, I need you, my love won't fade

776
00:53:35,127 --> 00:53:38,927
お生憎様の 慣れ果て 察して
Have pity on the ruins of this unfortunate soul

777
00:53:41,127 --> 00:53:44,427
無問題 破滅してみて
No problem, try bringing on the ruin

778
00:53:44,427 --> 00:53:47,427
Hold me tight トラウマの味
Hold me tight, the taste of trauma

779
00:53:47,427 --> 00:53:52,927
猛反対 お手 お座り で ハイ 報酬
Fierce opposition! Give me your paw, sit, yes, here's your reward

780
00:53:53,127 --> 00:53:56,327
喉の奥が チクンチクン
Deep in my throat, it's prickling

781
00:53:56,327 --> 00:53:59,127
僕は ドクンドクン
And my heart is pounding

782
00:53:59,127 --> 00:54:05,127
鼓動で孤独 消してみてよ
Try making the loneliness disappear with your heartbeat

783
00:54:05,427 --> 00:54:09,127
愛も恋も 淘汰して
Weed out both love and romance

784
00:54:09,427 --> 00:54:12,127
僕を独占して
Keep me all to yourself

785
00:54:12,127 --> 00:54:17,427
このまま中毒になるまで チューしよ
Let's kiss like this until we become addicted

786
00:54:17,427 --> 00:54:18,927
そして
And then...

787
00:54:18,927 --> 00:54:21,327
Get get get on! Get get get on! Get on chu!

788
00:54:21,327 --> 00:54:24,427
Get get get on! Get get get get on chu!

789
00:54:24,427 --> 00:54:29,427
熱く とろけるくらいに 溢れた気持ちが
My feelings overflow so much that they melt hotly

790
00:54:29,427 --> 00:54:31,727
たまらないでしょ
It's irresistible, isn't it?

791
00:54:31,727 --> 00:54:34,327
Get get get on! Get get get on! Get on chu!

792
00:54:34,327 --> 00:54:36,527
Get get get on! Get get get get on chu!

793
00:54:36,527 --> 00:54:37,927
Get on! Get on!

794
00:54:37,927 --> 00:54:40,127
我愛你 無問題
I love you, no problem

795
00:54:40,127 --> 00:54:43,127
Get get get on chu!

796
00:54:43,927 --> 00:54:46,927
ポン・チー・カン 勝負はいつも
Pon, chi, kan! The match is always...

797
00:54:46,927 --> 00:54:50,127
トンチンカン 僕に言わせりゃ
Absurd! If you ask me...

798
00:54:50,127 --> 00:54:55,727
ちんぷんかんぷん だ 最後はロンでしょ？
It's all gibberish. The end is won with a "Ron," right?

799
00:54:55,927 --> 00:54:59,727
もう何回？ 殺されればいい
How many more times must I be killed?

800
00:54:59,727 --> 00:55:01,927
Oh, One night 忘れられない
Oh, one night, I can't forget it

801
00:55:02,748 --> 00:55:08,148
終わんないでトキメキ偏愛予習
Don't let it end, this heart-fluttering rehearsal of devotion

802
00:55:08,748 --> 00:55:11,848
喉の奥がチクンチクン
Deep in my throat, it prickles

803
00:55:11,848 --> 00:55:15,048
僕はドクンドクン
My heart is thumping

804
00:55:15,048 --> 00:55:20,748
心臓ごと 引きずり出して見せてよ
Drag out your very heart and show it to me

805
00:55:21,548 --> 00:55:24,248
きもちいいね 面倒くさいけど
It feels good, even if it's a hassle

806
00:55:24,248 --> 00:55:27,148
やっぱ照れくさいけど
It's a bit embarrassing after all, but...

807
00:55:27,148 --> 00:55:33,048
死ぬまで忘れられないチューしよ
Let's share a kiss we'll never forget

808
00:55:33,548 --> 00:55:36,948
いかれた街はゾンビで溢れる
This crazy town is overflowing with zombies

809
00:55:36,948 --> 00:55:40,048
君は僕に恋してる
You are in love with me

810
00:55:40,048 --> 00:55:45,248
トキメク胸に繋がるループを引き抜けよ
Pull out the loop connected to your fluttering chest

811
00:55:46,448 --> 00:55:49,148
Bet bet bet on chu!

812
00:55:49,148 --> 00:55:52,448
Bet bet bet on chu!

813
00:55:52,548 --> 00:55:56,748
本気で狂えるくらいの愛しさが
A love so deep it could truly drive me mad...

814
00:55:57,048 --> 00:55:59,148
美しいでしょ
...is beautiful, isn't it?

815
00:55:59,248 --> 00:56:02,148
Get get get on chu!

816
00:56:02,148 --> 00:56:04,848
Get get get on chu! せーの
Get get get on chu! Ready, set...

817
00:56:04,848 --> 00:56:08,148
ポン・チー・カン 終わんない
Pon, Chii, Kan! It's not ending!

818
00:56:08,248 --> 00:56:11,248
Get Get Get on chu!

819
00:56:11,248 --> 00:56:14,448
我愛你 無問題
I love you, no problem!

820
00:56:14,448 --> 00:56:18,548
Get Get Get on chu!

821
00:56:24,748 --> 00:56:28,548
やった、やった！うまくいったしんよー！
We did it, we did it! It went perfectly, shin!

822
00:56:28,548 --> 00:56:32,948
ありがとう！よかったー！がんばったね、クロちゃん！
Thank you! That was great! You did your best, Kuro-chan!

823
00:56:32,948 --> 00:56:36,148
楽しかった、ありがとう！
That was so fun, thank you!

824
00:56:36,748 --> 00:56:40,648
えっと、さよならする前に、一個お願いしてもいいですか？
So, before we say goodbye, can we ask you for one favor?

825
00:56:42,748 --> 00:56:45,748
一個だけだしんよ？一個だけじゃん！
Only one, okay? Just one!

826
00:56:46,948 --> 00:56:52,748
フワモコは魔界の番犬で、バウバウをよく言ってるんですけど
Fuwamoco are guard dogs of the Underworld, and we often say 'Bau Bau'.

827
00:56:53,748 --> 00:57:00,448
クロちゃん、カメラに向かって、フワモコのように、可愛いバウバウをしてもらえますか？
Kuro-chan, could you face the camera and do a cute 'Bau Bau' like Fuwamoco?

828
00:57:00,948 --> 00:57:07,148
えー？できるかな？いくしんよ！バウバウ！
Eh? I wonder if I can? Here I go, shin! Bau Bau!

829
00:57:07,748 --> 00:57:13,948
えー？それがベスト？もう一回！もっとやって！
Eh? Was that your best? One more time! Do it more!

830
00:57:13,948 --> 00:57:18,948
バウバウ！...可愛いかな？
Bau Bau! ...Was that cute?

831
00:57:19,748 --> 00:57:23,648
実はもう一個やりたいことがあるんですけど
Actually, there is one more thing we want to do...

832
00:57:23,748 --> 00:57:24,748
何？
What is it?

833
00:57:24,748 --> 00:57:32,748
フワモコはいつもやってる自己紹介があって、できれば3人で一緒にやりたいです！
Fuwamoco has our usual self-introduction. We'd love to do it together with all three of us!

834
00:57:32,848 --> 00:57:36,048
あ、あれ可愛かったからやりたい、クロちゃんも！
Oh, that was so cute, I want to do it too!

835
00:57:36,748 --> 00:57:38,948
じゃ、いきますよ！
Alright, here we go!

836
00:57:38,948 --> 00:57:41,848
チワワじゃないよ！フワワだよ！
I'm not a Chihuahua! I'm Fuwawa!

837
00:57:41,848 --> 00:57:44,848
ワワワワワワ！フワワじゃないよ！クロちゃんだよ！
Wa-wa-wa-wa-wa! I'm not Fuwawa! I'm Kuro-chan!

838
00:57:44,848 --> 00:57:48,348
クロちゃんじゃないよ！もここだよ！
I am not Kuro-chan! I am Mococo!

839
00:57:48,748 --> 00:57:54,248
ほら、息合わせて！いやいやいや！怒らないで！どうしたの？
Hey, sync up with us! No, no, no! Don't get mad! What's wrong?

840
00:57:54,748 --> 00:57:58,748
出てって、クロちゃん！出ていかないから！なんなのそれ！
Get out, Kuro-chan! I'm not leaving! What is that about?!

841
00:57:58,748 --> 00:58:02,748
もう嘘とかつくよね。謝らないと...
You're lying to us again. If you don't apologize...

842
00:58:02,748 --> 00:58:09,748
もここパイキックしちゃう！
Mococo is going to pie-kick you!

843
00:58:09,848 --> 00:58:14,748
救急車、一台... いらないよ、もう嘘！
Call an ambulance... We don't need one, you're lying again!

844
00:58:14,748 --> 00:58:18,748
痛いってなんなのそれ！ぷんぷん！なんでぷんぷん怒るのちょっと！
I'm hurting, what is with that?! Hmph! Why are you getting huffy?!

845
00:58:18,748 --> 00:58:23,748
落ち着いて、落ち着いて！大丈夫、もこちゃん大丈夫。
Calm down, calm down! It's okay, Moko-chan, it's okay.

846
00:58:24,248 --> 00:58:32,248
クロちゃんはこれからも、みんなをいっぱい笑顔にして、素敵なアイドルになってくださいね！
Kuro-chan, please continue to make everyone smile and become a wonderful idol!

847
00:58:32,248 --> 00:58:34,248
なるしんよ！バウバウ！
I will, shin! Bau Bau!

848
00:58:34,748 --> 00:58:42,748
じゃ、もこちゃん、最後にクロちゃんにハイタッチしてお別れしようね。おっけー。仲直り仲直り？仲直りね！
Well, Moko-chan, let's high-five Kuro-chan to say goodbye. Okay. Making up? Yes, making up!

849
00:58:43,748 --> 00:58:47,748
はい、タッチ！ハイタッチ！ほらほら、ほらほらほら！
High-five! High-five! Come on, come on!

850
00:58:48,748 --> 00:58:54,248
やってみて、やってみて！ほら、やってやって！仲直り、仲直り！ていっ！
Give it a try! Come on, do it! Let's make up! Take that!

851
00:58:54,248 --> 00:58:59,748
あ、逃げちゃった！ひどくない、ちょっと！なんなの？
Ah, she ran away! Isn't that mean?! What is going on?!

852
00:59:00,248 --> 00:59:04,748
フワモコちゃん、本当にお誕生日おめでとうございます！
Fuwamoko, happy birthday, for real!

853
00:59:04,748 --> 00:59:14,748
ありがとう！おめでとうしんよー！キュンからのバッキュン！おめでとうハート！
Thank you! Happy birthday, shin! From a squeeze to a bang! Congratulations heart!

854
00:59:20,248 --> 00:59:28,748
Firework! Purple, blue, yellow fireworks! たまやー！かぎやー！
Fireworks! Purple, blue, and yellow fireworks! Tamaya! Kagiya!

855
00:59:29,248 --> 00:59:37,748
Wow! That was so much fun! Things got a little bit crazy there, not too sure what happened.

856
00:59:37,748 --> 00:59:41,748
もうカオスすぎて、わからなくなってきたかも！
It was so chaotic, I've completely lost track!

857
00:59:41,748 --> 00:59:49,748
But we still have one more... one more very exciting thing to show you! まだまだ楽しみがあるよ！
But we still have one more... one more very exciting thing to show you! There's still more fun to come!

858
00:59:49,748 --> 00:59:59,748
Maybe what it is... can you guess what it is? なにかな、なにかな？ Fuwamoko, our 1st Anniversary!
Maybe what it is... can you guess what it is? I wonder what it is! Fuwamoko's 1st Anniversary!

859
01:00:01,529 --> 01:00:02,829
We released our...

860
01:00:02,829 --> 01:00:04,029
first original song!

861
01:00:04,029 --> 01:00:06,029
which was Bau Bau!!

862
01:00:06,329 --> 01:00:08,329
And then for our first anniversary,

863
01:00:08,329 --> 01:00:10,629
we were able to release Lifetime Showtime!

864
01:00:10,629 --> 01:00:14,529
our original song that's been with us along this journey.

865
01:00:14,529 --> 01:00:17,029
Yeah, a very special song.

866
01:00:17,029 --> 01:00:19,529
And you know, for FuwaMoco,

867
01:00:19,529 --> 01:00:22,529
singing and dancing is something that means so much to us!

868
01:00:22,529 --> 01:00:24,529
Yeah, music!

869
01:00:24,529 --> 01:00:27,029
And, Ruffians, we might have heard

870
01:00:27,029 --> 01:00:29,629
that you'd like to hear more from us too, right?

871
01:00:29,629 --> 01:00:31,329
Right? Yeah! Yeah!

872
01:00:31,329 --> 01:00:33,429
What do you think? Yeah!

873
01:00:33,429 --> 01:00:35,529
Well...

874
01:00:35,529 --> 01:00:37,529
our announcement is...

875
01:00:37,529 --> 01:00:39,729
Drumroll!

876
01:00:39,729 --> 01:00:41,529
Okay, drumroll, Ruffians!

877
01:00:41,529 --> 01:00:45,729
Bau bau bau bau...

878
01:00:45,729 --> 01:00:46,829
Then...

879
01:00:46,829 --> 01:00:50,529
A new original song!

880
01:00:50,529 --> 01:00:54,029
FUWAMOCOの新規オリジナルソング！
FUWAMOCO's brand new original song!

881
01:00:54,029 --> 01:00:57,229
And this song is extra special!

882
01:00:57,229 --> 01:00:58,929
Yes! It's written by none other

883
01:00:58,929 --> 01:01:02,129
than the legendary rock idol song composer,

884
01:01:02,129 --> 01:01:04,529
Matsuoka Kenta-san!

885
01:01:04,529 --> 01:01:07,529
who works with many famous idol groups that we love!

886
01:01:07,529 --> 01:01:11,029
Also, written music for the idol group

887
01:01:11,029 --> 01:01:13,529
that Kuro-chan produces, MAMESHIBA NO TAIGUN-san!

888
01:01:13,529 --> 01:01:17,529
Yeah! But Ruffians, you might be a little bit surprised, okay?

889
01:01:17,529 --> 01:01:20,029
Yeah, so get ready!

890
01:01:20,029 --> 01:01:23,329
Ruffians... with this song,

891
01:01:23,329 --> 01:01:26,529
we'd like to express our ruff-est feelings as demon dogs.

892
01:01:29,529 --> 01:01:32,529
DEMON'S RESIDENCE

893
01:01:55,929 --> 01:01:58,629
「相棒、どこへ行こうか」
"My partner, where shall we go?"

894
01:01:58,629 --> 01:02:01,229
ネオンの脇を抜け
Passing by the neon lights,

895
01:02:01,229 --> 01:02:06,129
バブルガムがはじけたら let's go
Once the bubblegum pops, let's go!

896
01:02:06,129 --> 01:02:08,629
最低な夜を潜って
Diving through the worst night,

897
01:02:08,629 --> 01:02:11,129
僕らは群れをなす
we form a pack.

898
01:02:11,129 --> 01:02:16,129
「あの頃よりもマシだね」 my way
"It's better than back then, isn't it?" My way.

899
01:02:16,129 --> 01:02:19,529
「不完全なんです」首輪をつけた
"I'm incomplete," wearing a collar.

900
01:02:19,529 --> 01:02:25,529
良い子なんかじゃもうイヤ (Ah)
I don't want to be a good girl anymore! (Ah!)

901
01:02:26,029 --> 01:02:29,029
DEMON'S RESIDENCE 噛みついていけ
DEMON'S RESIDENCE, bite down and go on!

902
01:02:29,029 --> 01:02:31,529
この街は檻のようで
This city is like a cage.

903
01:02:31,529 --> 01:02:33,929
気分はどうだい 泣いているのかい
How are you feeling? Are you crying?

904
01:02:33,929 --> 01:02:36,429
鎖をちぎって
Break the chains!

905
01:02:36,429 --> 01:02:39,229
叫んでいたいんだ stray dogs 遥か
I want to keep screaming, stray dogs, far away...

906
01:02:39,229 --> 01:02:41,529
彼方へと飛ぶ鳥を
towards the distance, at the birds flying.

907
01:02:41,529 --> 01:02:44,029
見上げるだけかい それでいいのかい
Will you just look up at them? Is that enough for you?

908
01:02:44,029 --> 01:02:49,029
燃えるなら ほら 青く
If you're going to burn, look, burn blue!

909
01:02:57,229 --> 01:03:00,029
「説教なんかいらない」
"I don't need a sermon,"

910
01:03:00,029 --> 01:03:02,129
スプレー缶振って
shaking a spray can.

911
01:03:02,129 --> 01:03:07,129
イタズラ書きで彩る runway
Decorating the runway with graffiti.

912
01:03:07,129 --> 01:03:10,029
愛情なんか coin toss
Love is like a coin toss,

913
01:03:10,029 --> 01:03:12,029
誰に bet するのか
who are you betting on?

914
01:03:12,029 --> 01:03:17,029
不確定要素ばかりね lonely
Nothing but uncertain elements, how lonely.

915
01:03:17,529 --> 01:03:22,529
二人でひとつと決めた
